arguments.prompt:
Read /workspace/briefs/global.json. Compose one JSON object with these top-level keys, in this order:
  evaluations            -> a JSON list of the eight mapper objects below, in the order A, B, C, D, E, F, G, H
  accepted_solutions     -> the accepted_solutions value from global.json
  rejected_solutions     -> the rejected_solutions value from global.json
  best_solution          -> the best_solution value from global.json
  summary                -> the summary value from global.json
Write the final JSON to /logs/agent/output.json. Validate that /logs/agent/output.json exists and parses as JSON. Return only WRITTEN.

